  "body_html": "<p>Welcome to Jeminise, where comfort meets passion! Dive into the world of softball with our vibrant Comforter Set, specially designed for softball players, fans, and lovers. This set transforms any bedroom into a cheering stand, celebrating the spirit of the game with its bright teal and yellow hues. It’s the perfect way to show team pride or an ideal gift for the sports enthusiast in your life.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Type:</strong> Enjoy a complete Comforter Set that brings dynamic style to your bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Celebrate your love for softball with a bedding set that embodies team spirit and dedication.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, durable, and fade-resistant feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Breathability:</strong> Microfiber material ensures a cool and breathable sleep experience, outlasting cotton.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low. For best results, wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization:</strong> Features 2 text input options for a personalized touch.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Fade Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
